Axilla
(400)
Floor (399)
Axillary fascia from serratus ant 
¨
deep
fascia of arm & over axillary folds.
-
broad 
suspensory ligament
runs
from pec minor to the fascial floor
Anterior wall
Pec major and minor, subclavius,
clavipectoral fascia.
Posterior wall (397)
Subscapularis, teres major, lat dorsi tendon
- anterior and post walls converge on
intertubercular groove
with long head of biceps between.

