2.4:
The Breast
Breast
(167-9)
Base:
from ribs 2-6;
from sternal edge to near midaxillary lines;
Overlies
: pec major,
serratus anterior, small part of rectus and external oblique.
A 
modified sweat gland
,
breast is confined 
between
superficial and deep layers of 
superficial fascia
.

